    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d447-a1">

                <pb facs="0469" n="1203" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1203"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Handed to Mr. Adee by Dr. Gaytan, Secretary of the
                        Spanish Legation, October 8, 1895.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Spain in Washington</hi></placeName>[, <date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-head" calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-10-08">undated</date>].</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Spanish consul in Key West wires that leaders and considerable number of men
                    left the Keys; that the <hi rendition="#italic">Cincinnati</hi> is in port; that
                    the <hi rendition="#italic">Woodall</hi> is about to start from New Orleans,
                    conveying the party, and that the <hi rendition="#italic">Childs</hi>, probably
                    now in Key West, is preparing to sail. Consul in Tampa reports expedition is now
                    in Pine Reef.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
